{"version": 2, "width": 78, "height": 66, "timestamp": 1787913482, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}}
[0.187879, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.541046, "o", "  ONE DEPOT, ONE NIGHT, TWO SETTLEMENTS\r\n"]
[0.667844, "o", "  depot-north — 18 vans on a congestion-constrained connection\r\n"]
[0.800338, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.16433, "o", "ACT 1  the meter reports\r\n"]
[2.071596, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.204154, "o", "  02:00: 22 kW   register 105500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.336619, "o", "  02:15: 22 kW   register 111000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.466971, "o", "  02:30: 22 kW   register 116500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.599005, "o", "  02:45: 22 kW   register 122000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.731845, "o", "  03:00: 22 kW   register 127500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.863908, "o", "  03:15: 15 kW   register 131250 Wh\r\n"]
[2.992641, "o", "  03:30: 15 kW   register 135000 Wh\r\n"]
[3.127258, "o", "  03:45: 15 kW   register 138750 Wh\r\n"]
[3.261109, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.614683, "o", "  every reading signed by the charge point's own key, verifiable\r\n"]
[3.74194, "o", "  offline by anyone holding the platform's public key\r\n"]
[3.873958, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.22924, "o", "ACT 2  the aggregator asks to curtail\r\n"]
[5.138147, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[5.263009, "o", "  03:14: curtail depot-north-cp-04 from 22 kW to 7 kW for 40 minutes\r\n"]
[5.392, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.755395, "o", "  no capability: REFUSED — malformed capability token\r\n"]
[5.88053, "o", "  wrong issuer: REFUSED — capability token signature is not valid for this issuer\r\n"]
[6.01544, "o", "  the real capability: held for review — shed of 15000W is at or above the review threshold of 11000W\r\n"]
[6.148828, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.503917, "o", "  15 kW is within the 15 kW granted but past the 11 kW review threshold,\r\n"]
[6.636809, "o", "  and no operator is wired in — so the command is NOT dispatched.\r\n"]
[6.770837, "o", "  Nothing reached the charge point. The refusal is on the record.\r\n"]
[6.905114, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.265574, "o", "  re-presented, 7 kW shed: allowed\r\n"]
[7.400177, "o", "  03:14: SetChargingProfile dispatched, hung under the authority that permitted it\r\n"]
[7.534304, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.892537, "o", "ACT 3  morning — two settlements, one chain\r\n"]
[8.806307, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[8.936429, "o", "  energy bill: 38 kWh   EUR 10.64\r\n"]
[9.066858, "o", "  flexibility payment: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48\r\n"]
[9.200017, "o", "  baseline used: 22 kW, metered 15 kW\r\n"]
[9.33433, "o", "  method: nominated baseline  fingerprint e19ee448668d7b77\r\n"]
[9.462085, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.817658, "o", "  aggregator invoices: 10 kWh — the 15 kW shed it asked for at 03:14\r\n"]
[9.948223, "o", "  meter says: 4666 Wh — the 7 kW shed that was actually dispatched\r\n"]
[10.081342, "o", "  over-claim: 114%\r\n"]
[10.215571, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.574877, "o", "  the deep shed was HELD in Act 2, so it never reached the meter.\r\n"]
[10.70904, "o", "  The invoice does not know that. The measurement does — and the\r\n"]
[10.835324, "o", "  flexibility payment above is the measured figure, not the claimed one.\r\n"]
[10.968968, "o", "  The percentage is recorded, not enforced: a threshold belongs in a\r\n"]
[11.103381, "o", "  contract, not in a library.\r\n"]
[11.235021, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.591373, "o", "  both derive from the same signed readings. Walking up from either:\r\n"]
[11.720292, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.084755, "o", "    settlement.flex\r\n"]
[12.208873, "o", "    curtail.applied\r\n"]
[12.335753, "o", "    grid.allowed\r\n"]
[12.463085, "o", "    grid.intent\r\n"]
[12.593974, "o", "    curtail.command\r\n"]
[12.725008, "o", "    meter.reading\r\n"]
[12.849161, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.210787, "o", "ACT 4  somebody edits a meter value\r\n"]
[14.119869, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[14.253236, "o", "  edit: 03:15 register 131250 Wh -> 134750 Wh   (+3.5 kWh of flexibility, worth EUR 0.42)\r\n"]
[14.388018, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.753313, "o", "  result: signature check fails at 03:15 — that reading, and only that reading\r\n"]
[14.888077, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.251587, "o", "  the edit did not need to be guessed at. Every other reading still\r\n"]
[15.387324, "o", "  verifies, so the chain names the one that does not.\r\n"]
[15.515193, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.87716, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[16.010399, "o", "  Every settlement above walks back to a signed meter reading,\r\n"]
[16.143406, "o", "  through the capability that authorised the command that changed it.\r\n"]
[16.274321, "o", "  A command without that authority never reached the charge point.\r\n"]
[16.407773, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.772385, "o", "  The baseline remains a model. This makes the flexibility claim\r\n"]
[16.900924, "o", "  checkable and replayable by any party — not true.\r\n"]
[17.031466, "o", "\r\n"]
